Launched by the Ministry of Micro, Small & Medium Enterprises , Incubation Scheme Under MSME Innovative Scheme aims to promote and support untapped creativity and to promote adoption of latest technologies in MSMEs that seek the validation of their ideas at the proof-of-concept level. The scheme also supports engagement with enablers who will advise such MSMEs in expanding the business by supporting them in design, strategy and execution. **Activities:**

- Recognition of eligible institutions as Host Institute (HI) to act as Business Incubator (BI);
- Approval of Ideas of Incubatees submitted through Host Institute (HI);
- Assistance for nurturing of Ideas to HI;
- Assistance towards Capital Support to HI for Plant and Machiner.
